<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προξεν-ία</span></b> , Thess. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προξεννία</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			9(2).258.6
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			9
		</span></i> (Cierium, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>): ἡ:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>relation of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόξενος,</span>
			<i>treaty</i> or <i>compact of friendship between a state and a
				foreigner,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				<u>Fr.</u>
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.89
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προξενίᾳ πέποιθα</span> I trust
				<i>my public friendship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.65
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>O.</u>
				9.83
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ π. ἐξευρήσεις;</span> what
				<i>protector</i> wilt thou find? <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				359
			</span></i> (anap., v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>status and privileges of a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόξενος,</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π., εὐεργεσία, ἀπέλεια ἁπάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					20.60
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν παλαιὰν π . . . ἣν τοῦ
				πάππου ἀπειπόντος αὐτὸς</span> [sc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Ἀλκιβιάδης . . διενοεῖτο
					ἀνανεώσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.43
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν π. ὑμῶν . . πατρὸς πατὴρ πατρῴαν
					ἔχων παρεδίδου τῷ γένει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρὸς Οηβαίους π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.141
				</span></i>
			; freq. in Inscrr., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.116.40
			</span></i>, etc.; coupled with other privileges, e.g. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προνομία, προπραξία,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9(1).442.4
			</span></i> (Stratos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεία, ἀσυλία</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9(2).62.12
			</span></i> (Lamia, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγγυος τᾶς π.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγγυος τᾶν π. ὁ γραμματεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					629.31
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>inscription</i> or <i>written instrument in witness of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προξενία,</span> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				54.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
